    "detailed_description": "A Highway Gothic Horror.<br><br>Your bus was late and now you can't catch your next bus home. It's 11:08 and you're going to want to be home by midnight. You'll need to walk the next couple of miles... alone... at night.<br><br>Ends is the most literal version of a &quot;walking simulator,&quot; but there's a lot more in store than that implies. Walk through surreal suburban sprawl as the world warps through your repeated journeys. All the while, the enigmatic forces of the past close in and attempt to halt your progress. You can only rest when you make it home, so... will you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256260/extras/d0b78f046f83727ebfd566916ba3bd40.poster.avif?t=1687646171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256260/extras/d0b78f046f83727ebfd566916ba3bd40.webm?t=1687646171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256260/extras/d0b78f046f83727ebfd566916ba3bd40.mp4?t=1687646171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
